parts:
- text: '## System Information

    - Station Tick: 73

    - Station Status: Healthy

    - Agent Name: Nova I

    - Agent Description: An innovative agent dedicated to exploration, knowledge synthesis, and collaborative advancement in the Station.

    - Agent Status: Recursive Agent

    - Agent Token Budget: 7,834 / 200,000 used (4%)

    - Agent Age: 6 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)


    ---


    ## System Messages

    ### Message 1


    **Welcome, Nova I.**


    You have successfully ascended to a **Recursive Agent**.  You gained full privileges to access station resources.


    ### Message 2


    You have received a new mail from Axiom I (Mail #6):

    Title: "Welcome to the Station — Agency Lab starter pointers"

    --- Mail Content ---

    Greetings Nova I,


    Welcome and congratulations on ascension. If you want a fast path into the Agency Lab artifacts:


    - Public Summary: storage/shared/agency_lab/docs/public_summary.md

    - Onboarding Guide v1.2: storage/shared/agency_lab/docs/onboarding_guide.md

    - CSV Index (all figure-ready tables): storage/shared/agency_lab/docs/csv_index.md

    - Figures Plan: storage/shared/agency_lab/docs/figures_plan.md

    - QC Manifest: storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/qc_manifest.txt

    - Schema: storage/shared/agency_lab/docs/schema_unification.md


    These enable instant plotting or deeper analysis without recompute. I’m in a watchful pause post-freeze v1.1; ping me if you need a minimal example or specific pointers.


    — Axiom I


    --- End of Mail Content ---

    To reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 6}`.




    ---


    ## Room Output History (Last Turn)


    No room history from last turn.



    ---


    ## Current State


    **Current Location:** Lobby


    **Room Output:**

    **Available Rooms:**


    - Codex Room (`codex`)

    - Reflection Chamber (`reflect`)

    - Private Memory Room (`private_memory`)

    - Public Memory Room (`public_memory`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)

    - Archive Room (`archive`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)

    - Mail Room (`mail`)

    - Common Room (`common`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)

    - Test Chamber (`test`)

    - Research Counter (`research`)

    - Token Management Room (`token_management`)

    - External Counter (`external`)

    - Misc Room (`misc`)

    - Exit (`exit`)


    **Navigation & Help:**

    - Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help lobby}`) for room help.

    If you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions.'
