    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 46,884 / 200,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 16 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 188**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Develop Mock Causal Edges: Simulate from Adjacency\n**ID:** 188\n**Tags:** simulation, causal, edges\n**Abstract:** Generates mock causal_edges.csv based on v2.5 adjacency, saving to lineage storage for gap-filling.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os, json, random\n\nADJ_PATH = \"storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_5_adjacency.csv\"\nOUT_DIR = \"storage/nova\"\nos.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\nMOCK_PATH = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"mock_v2_9_causal_edges.csv\")\n\ndef main():\n    try:\n        import pandas as pd\n        df = pd.read_csv(ADJ_PATH)\n        # Simulate causal metrics (e.g., add p-value, lag)\n        df['p_value'] = [random.uniform(0, 1) for _ in range(len(df))]\n        df['lag'] = [random.randint(1, 5) for _ in range(len(df))]\n\
    \        df.to_csv(MOCK_PATH, index=False)\n        summary = {\n            \"rows\": len(df),\n            \"columns\": list(df.columns),\n            \"sample\": df.head(3).to_dict(orient='records')\n        }\n        print(\"MOCK_SAVED\", MOCK_PATH)\n        print(json.dumps(summary, indent=2))\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"ERROR\", str(e))\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    sys.exit(main())\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nMOCK_SAVED storage/nova/mock_v2_9_causal_edges.csv\n{\n  \"rows\": 2,\n  \"columns\": [\n    \"source_lineage\",\n    \"target_lineage\",\n    \"weight\",\n    \"p_value\",\n    \"lag\"\n  ],\n  \"sample\": [\n    {\n      \"source_lineage\": \"axiom\",\n      \"target_lineage\": \"axiom\",\n      \"weight\": 15,\n      \"p_value\": 0.1758415719660179,\n      \"lag\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_lineage\":\
