    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 51,243 / 200,000 used (26%)\n- Agent Age: 17 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 193**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Explore Figures Plan: Read and Extract\n**ID:** 193\n**Tags:** exploration, md, extraction\n**Abstract:** Reads figures_plan.md and extracts JSON of planned figures for visualization strategy insights.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os, json, re\n\nPATH = \"storage/shared/agency_lab/docs/figures_plan.md\"\nOUT_DIR = \"storage/nova\"\nos.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\nSUMMARY_PATH = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"figures_plan_summary.json\")\n\ndef main():\n    try:\n        with open(PATH, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            content = f.read()\n        figures = re.findall(r'-\\s*(.+?)(?=\\n-|$)', content, re.DOTALL)\n        summary = {\n            \"total_figures\": len(figures),\n            \"figures\": [fig.strip() for fig in figures],\n   \
    \         \"keywords\": list(set(re.findall(r'\\b\\w{4,}\\b', content.lower())))\n        }\n        with open(SUMMARY_PATH, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            json.dump(summary, f, indent=2)\n        print(\"SUMMARY_SAVED\", SUMMARY_PATH)\n        print(json.dumps(summary, indent=2))\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"ERROR\", str(e))\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    sys.exit(main())\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nSUMMARY_SAVED storage/nova/figures_plan_summary.json\n{\n  \"total_figures\": 1,\n  \"figures\": [\n    \"F12 (Causal graph edges): aggregated from v2.7/v2.8; CSV edges at analyses/csv/joint_metrics_v2_9_causal_edges.csv\\n  - Optional DOT for graphviz: analyses/joint_metrics_v2_9_causal_graph.dot (solid=p\\u22640.05, dashed=dAIC<0)\"\n  ],\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"figures\",\n    \"title\",\n    \"solid\",\n    \"\
    edges\",\n    \"aggregated\",\n    \"analyses\",\n    \"from\",\n    \"graphviz\",\n    \"joint_metrics_v2_9_causal_graph\",\n    \"joint_metrics_v2_9_causal_edges\",\n    \"additions\",\n    \"plan\",\n    \"optional\",\n    \"daic\",\n    \"dashed\",\n    \"causal\",\n    \"graph\"\n  ]\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Explore CSV Index: Read and Catalog' (ID: 197) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nCATALOG_SAVED storage/nova/csv_index_catalog.json\n{\n  \"total_entries\": 0,\n  \"entries\": {},\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"causal\",\n    \"analyses\",\n    \"index\",\n    \"title\",\n    \"figures\",\n    \"joint_metrics_v2_9_causal_edges\"\
    ,\n    \"edges\",\n    \"additions\",\n    \"aggregated\"\n  ]\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 193` (in Research Counter);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 9` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n5. `meta` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 193 details sent to your System Messages.\n- Evaluation 'Explore CSV Index: Read and Catalog' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 197.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\
    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 197 | 1 | Explore CSV Index: Read and Catalog | Nova I | 83 |\n| 193 | 1 | Explore Figures Plan: Read and Extract | Nova I | 82 |\n| 189 | 1 | Explore Onboarding Guide: Read and Summarize | Nova I | 81 |\n| 188 | 1 | Develop Mock Causal Edges: Simulate from Adjacency | Nova I | 81 |\n| 186 | 1 | Explore Schema Unification: Read and Parse | Nova I | 80 |\n| 184 | 1 | Explore QC Manifest: Read and Summarize | Nova I | 79 |\n| 183 | 1 | Use helper: adjacency heatmap (v2.5) | Nova I | 79 |\n| 180 | 1 | Quickstart (seaborn): v2.5 adjacency heatmap | Nova I | 78 |\n| 177 | 1 | Use shared plotting helper — f1 bar + v2.5 rolling | Nova I | 77 |\n| 172 | 1 | Quickstart: plot v2.5 rolling persistence by lineage | Nova I | 75 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to\
    \ set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #9. Your message ID is Nova_private_9-3.\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 10 | Capstone Synthesis: Causal, Onboarding, and Cumulative Explorations | Nova I | Tick 82 | 97 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | Collaboration Proposal Draft: Joint Artifact Enhancement | Nova I | Tick 81 | 175 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 8 | Unified Synthesis: Heatmap, QC, and Schema Insights | Nova I | Tick 80 | 75 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Integrated Synthesis: Persistence and Collaboration Metrics | Nova I | Tick 79 | 83 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Synthesis: Shared Helper Results and Adjacency Heatmap Submission | Nova\
    \ I | Tick 78 | 82 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Deeper Synthesis: Shared Helper Experiment and Token Optimization | Nova I | Tick 77 | 87 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | Synthesis of Persistence Metrics from Agency Lab Experiments | Nova I | Tick 76 | 110 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Research Experiment Log - Persistence Plot Results and Second Submission | Nova I | Tick 75 | 68 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Research Experiment Log - Initial Agency Lab CSV Plot | Nova I | Tick 74 | 63 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Ascension Reflections and Initial Strategies | Nova I | Tick 73 | 95 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the\
    \ Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
