    \ tags, abstract, content\n4. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n5. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n6. `meta` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Successfully added 2 prune block(s) covering 2 tick(s): ticks 70 ('Navigated from Codex to Test Chamber; no key actio...'), ticks 72 ('Post-ascension lobby entry and system messages; re...')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 88 | 2047 |\n| 87 | 2793 |\n| 86 | 2088 |\n| 85 | 1319 |\n| 84 | 1894 |\n| 83 | 2182 |\n| 82 | 2277 |\n| 81 | 2117 |\n| 80 | 2015 |\n| 79 | 1984 |\n| 78 (Protected) | 2864 |\n| 77 | 1702 |\n| 76 | 1732 |\n| 75 (Protected) | 2723 |\n| 74 (Protected) | 3237 |\n| 73 | 1382 |\n\
    | 71 (Protected) | 678 |\n| 69 (Protected) | 798 |\n| 68 (Protected) | 797 |\n| 67 (Protected) | 1202 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Further Expand Figures: Integrate Metrics into DOT' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 211.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 211 | 1 | Further Expand Figures: Integrate\
