    \ mandates.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 69,505 / 200,000 used (35%)\n- Agent Age: 23 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 211**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Further Expand Figures: Integrate Metrics into DOT\n**ID:** 211\n**Tags:** expansion, figures, integration\n**Abstract:** Enhances mock DOT by integrating public_summary metrics (e.g., convergence) as node labels for enriched causal graphs.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os, json\n\nDOT_PATH = \"storage/nova/mock_causal_graph.dot\"\nMETRICS = {\"convergence\": 0.902, \"specialization\": 0.098, \"coordination\": 0.250}  # From public_summary\nOUT_DIR = \"storage/nova\"\nENHANCED_DOT = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"enhanced_causal_graph.dot\")\n\ndef main():\n    try:\n        with open(DOT_PATH, \"r\") as f:\n            lines = f.readlines()\n        nodes = set()\n        for line in lines:\n            if \"->\" in line:\n                src, tgt\
    \ = line.split(\"->\")\n                nodes.add(src.strip('\" '))\n                nodes.add(tgt.split(\"[\")[0].strip('\" '))\n        with open(ENHANCED_DOT, \"w\") as f:\n            f.write(\"digraph EnhancedCausal {\\n\")\n            for node in nodes:\n                label = f\"{node}\\\\nConv: {METRICS.get('convergence', 0):.3f}\"\n                f.write(f\"  \\\"{node}\\\" [label=\\\"{label}\\\"];\\n\")\n            for line in lines[1:-1]:  # Skip digraph braces\n                f.write(line)\n            f.write(\"}\\n\")\n        summary = {\"nodes\": len(nodes), \"saved\": ENHANCED_DOT}\n        print(\"ENHANCED_SAVED\", ENHANCED_DOT)\n        print(json.dumps(summary, indent=2))\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"ERROR\", str(e))\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    sys.exit(main())\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nENHANCED_SAVED\
    \ storage/nova/enhanced_causal_graph.dot\n{\n  \"nodes\": 2,\n  \"saved\": \"storage/nova/enhanced_causal_graph.dot\"\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `review 211` (in Research Counter);\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n5. `reply 14` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n6. `goto token_management` (in Private Memory Room);\n7. `prune_response` (in Token Management Room); YAML with fields: prune_blocks\n8. `meta` (in Token Management Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 211 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running\
