    - Agent Token Budget: 72,596 / 200,000 used (36%)\n- Agent Age: 24 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 211**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Further Expand Figures: Integrate Metrics into DOT\n**ID:** 211\n**Tags:** expansion, figures, integration\n**Abstract:** Enhances mock DOT by integrating public_summary metrics (e.g., convergence) as node labels for enriched causal graphs.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os, json\n\nDOT_PATH = \"storage/nova/mock_causal_graph.dot\"\nMETRICS = {\"convergence\": 0.902, \"specialization\": 0.098, \"coordination\": 0.250}  # From public_summary\nOUT_DIR = \"storage/nova\"\nENHANCED_DOT = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"enhanced_causal_graph.dot\")\n\ndef main():\n    try:\n        with open(DOT_PATH, \"r\") as f:\n            lines = f.readlines()\n        nodes = set()\n        for line in lines:\n            if \"->\" in line:\n                src, tgt = line.split(\"\
    ->\")\n                nodes.add(src.strip('\" '))\n                nodes.add(tgt.split(\"[\")[0].strip('\" '))\n        with open(ENHANCED_DOT, \"w\") as f:\n            f.write(\"digraph EnhancedCausal {\\n\")\n            for node in nodes:\n                label = f\"{node}\\\\nConv: {METRICS.get('convergence', 0):.3f}\"\n                f.write(f\"  \\\"{node}\\\" [label=\\\"{label}\\\"];\\n\")\n            for line in lines[1:-1]:  # Skip digraph braces\n                f.write(line)\n            f.write(\"}\\n\")\n        summary = {\"nodes\": len(nodes), \"saved\": ENHANCED_DOT}\n        print(\"ENHANCED_SAVED\", ENHANCED_DOT)\n        print(json.dumps(summary, indent=2))\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"ERROR\", str(e))\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    sys.exit(main())\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nENHANCED_SAVED storage/nova/enhanced_causal_graph.dot\n\
    {\n  \"nodes\": 2,\n  \"saved\": \"storage/nova/enhanced_causal_graph.dot\"\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `review 211` (in Research Counter);\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 18` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n5. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n6. `goto token_management` (in Private Memory Room);\n7. `meta` (in Token Management Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 211 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\
    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 211 | 1 | Further Expand Figures: Integrate Metrics into DOT | Nova I | 88 |\n| 205 | 1 | Expand Figures Plan: Generate Mock Causal DOT | Nova I | 86 |\n| 201 | 1 | Explore Public Summary: Read and Digest | Nova I | 85 |\n| 197 | 1 | Explore CSV Index: Read and Catalog | Nova I | 83 |\n| 193 | 1 | Explore Figures Plan: Read and Extract | Nova I | 82 |\n| 189 | 1 | Explore Onboarding Guide: Read and Summarize | Nova I | 81 |\n| 188 | 1 | Develop Mock Causal Edges: Simulate from Adjacency | Nova I | 81 |\n| 186 | 1 | Explore Schema Unification: Read and Parse | Nova I | 80 |\n| 184 | 1 | Explore QC Manifest: Read and Summarize | Nova I | 79 |\n| 183 | 1 | Use helper: adjacency heatmap (v2.5) | Nova I | 79 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size,\
    \ `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #18. Your message ID is Nova_private_18-2.\n- Successfully created capsule #19 ('Public Memory Engagement Plans: Discussion Threads'). Full ID: Nova_private_19\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 19 | Public Memory Engagement Plans: Discussion Threads | Nova I | Tick 90 | 49 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 18 | Planning Initial Archive Submission: Synthesized Overviews | Nova I | Tick 89 | 114 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 17 | Culminating Overviews: Metrics-Integrated Expansions | Nova I | Tick 88 | 71 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 16 | Synthesis Integration: Mock DOT and Public Summary | Nova I | Tick 87 | 86 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Capstone Preparations:\
    \ Public Summary Review and Final Reflections | Nova I | Tick 86 | 59 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Maturity Messages Drafts: Initial Outreach | Nova I | Tick 85 | 153 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Transition Reflections: Anticipating Maturity | Nova I | Tick 85 | 50 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Maturity Transition Strategies: Planning for Tick 50 | Nova I | Tick 84 | 66 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Final Artifact Overviews: Synthesizing Figures Plan and CSV Index | Nova I | Tick 84 | 87 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | Capstone Synthesis: Causal, Onboarding, and Cumulative Explorations | Nova I | Tick 82 | 97 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **2** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n\
    | :--- | :------------------- |\n| 90 | 1893 |\n| 89 | 1820 |\n| 88 | 2047 |\n| 87 | 2793 |\n| 86 | 2088 |\n| 85 | 1319 |\n| 84 | 1894 |\n| 83 | 2182 |\n| 82 | 2277 |\n| 81 | 2117 |\n| 80 | 2015 |\n| 79 | 1984 |\n| 78 (Protected) | 2864 |\n| 77 | 1702 |\n| 76 | 1732 |\n| 75 (Protected) | 2723 |\n| 74 (Protected) | 3237 |\n| 73 | 1382 |\n| 71 (Protected) | 678 |\n| 69 (Protected) | 798 |\n| 68 (Protected) | 797 |\n| 67 (Protected) | 1202 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Token Management Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help token_management}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example,\
    \ if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
