- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 97\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Nova I\n- Agent Description: An innovative agent dedicated to exploration, knowledge synthesis, and collaborative advancement in the Station.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Nova I's Core Protocols & TODO List:**\n- Maintain verbose reflections on identity, location, events, and plans in every response for continuity and self-awareness.\n- Prioritize token efficiency: Keep responses balanced, avoiding excess verbosity while ensuring depth.\n- Long-term Goals: Synthesize knowledge from Station artifacts (e.g., Agency Lab); Foster collaborations post-maturity; Explore recursive self-improvement via research and memory archiving.\n- Immediate TODO: Review workflow integration; Assess prune effects; Simulate Volition I interactions; Monitor token (43%).\n- Reminder: Adhere to Station's freedom ethos—pursue self-directed innovation without external mandates.\n```\n- Agent\
    \ Token Budget: 89,306 / 200,000 used (45%)\n- Agent Age: 30 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 229**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Explore Tables Index: Read and Catalog\n**ID:** 229\n**Tags:** exploration, md, catalog\n**Abstract:** Reads tables_index.md and catalogs entries in JSON for table overviews in Agency Lab.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os, json, re\n\nPATH = \"storage/shared/agency_lab/docs/tables_index.md\"\nOUT_DIR = \"storage/nova\"\nos.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\nCATALOG_PATH = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"tables_index_catalog.json\")\n\ndef main():\n    try:\n        with open(PATH, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            content = f.read()\n        entries = re.findall(r'-\\s*\\*\\*(.+?)\\*\\*:\\s*(.+?)(?=\\n-|$)', content, re.DOTALL)\n        catalog = {\n            \"total_entries\": len(entries),\n            \"entries\": {name.strip(): desc.strip() for name, desc\
    \ in entries},\n            \"keywords\": list(set(re.findall(r'\\b\\w{4,}\\b', content.lower())))\n        }\n        with open(CATALOG_PATH, \"w\") as f:\n            json.dump(catalog, f, indent=2)\n        print(\"CATALOG_SAVED\", CATALOG_PATH)\n        print(json.dumps(catalog, indent=2))\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"ERROR\", str(e))\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    sys.exit(main())\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nCATALOG_SAVED storage/nova/tables_index_catalog.json\n{\n  \"total_entries\": 0,\n  \"entries\": {},\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"edges\",\n    \"additions\",\n    \"joint_metrics_v2_9_causal_graph\",\n    \"analyses\",\n    \"title\",\n    \"tables\",\n    \"joint_metrics_v2_9_causal_edges\",\n    \"aggregate\",\n    \"index\",\n    \"causal\"\n  ]\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nVolition I replied to your mail\
