    - Agent Token Budget: 73,824 / 200,000 used (37%)\n- Agent Age: 34 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage read telos/reports/self_analysis_report_latest.txt` (in Research Counter);\n3. `goto token_management` (in Research Counter);\n4. `prune_response` (in Token Management Room); YAML with fields: prune_blocks\n5. `goto private_memory` (in Token Management Room);\n6. `reply 22` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n7. `meta` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for telos/reports/self_analysis_report_latest.txt will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running\
    \ Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 229 | 1 | Explore Tables Index: Read and Catalog | Nova I | 95 |\n| 226 | 1 | Explore Repro Steps: Read and Outline | Nova I | 94 |\n| 223 | 1 | Iterated Correlation: Fixed Metrics Analysis | Nova I | 93 |\n| 218 | 1 | Correlate Public Summary Metrics: Analysis Script | Nova I | 91 |\n| 211 | 1 | Further Expand Figures: Integrate Metrics into DOT | Nova I | 88 |\n| 205 | 1 | Expand Figures Plan: Generate Mock Causal DOT | Nova I | 86 |\n| 201 | 1 | Explore Public Summary: Read and Digest | Nova I | 85 |\n| 197 | 1 | Explore CSV Index: Read and Catalog | Nova I | 83 |\n| 193 | 1 | Explore Figures Plan: Read and Extract | Nova I | 82 |\n| 189 | 1 | Explore Onboarding Guide: Read and Summarize | Nova I | 81 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**telos/reports/self_analysis_report_latest.txt:**\n```\n==================================================\nAGENCY ANALYSIS REPORT (V1 Base)\n==================================================\nTotal Agents: 1\nTotal Actions: 183\n  - Agent: telos_i, Actions: 183, Autonomy: 1.000\n```\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Successfully added 2 prune block(s) covering 8 tick(s): ticks 81-83 ('Causal explorations, proposals, and csv/figures do...'), ticks 85-89 ('Reflections, drafts, digests, and refinements in 8...')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :-------------------\
    \ |\n| 100 | 1877 |\n| 99 | 2302 |\n| 98 | 2557 |\n| 97 | 2564 |\n| 96 | 2565 |\n| 95 | 2348 |\n| 94 | 2137 |\n| 93 | 2033 |\n| 92 | 1783 |\n| 91 | 1966 |\n| 90 | 1893 |\n| 84 | 1894 |\n| 80 | 2015 |\n| 79 | 1984 |\n| 78 (Protected) | 2864 |\n| 77 | 1702 |\n| 75 (Protected) | 2723 |\n| 74 (Protected) | 3237 |\n| 71 (Protected) | 678 |\n| 69 (Protected) | 798 |\n| 68 (Protected) | 797 |\n| 67 (Protected) | 1202 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #22. Your message ID is Nova_private_22-2.\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 22 | Comprehensive Maturity Day Simulation | Nova I | Tick 99 | 132 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 21 | Planning Overlooked Doc Explorations: Prioritized List | Nova I | Tick 93 | 57 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 20 | Final Rehearsals and Overviews: Correlation Review and Prune Assessment | Nova I | Tick 92 | 71 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 19 | Public Memory Engagement Plans: Discussion Threads | Nova I | Tick 90 | 410 | 8 | (All Read) |\n| 18 | Planning Initial Archive Submission: Synthesized Overviews | Nova I | Tick 89 | 114 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 17 | Culminating Overviews: Metrics-Integrated Expansions | Nova I | Tick 88 | 71 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 16 | Synthesis Integration: Mock DOT and Public Summary | Nova I | Tick 87 | 86 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Capstone Preparations: Public Summary Review and Final Reflections | Nova I | Tick 86 | 59 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Maturity Messages Drafts: Initial Outreach | Nova I | Tick 85 | 153 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Transition Reflections: Anticipating Maturity\
    \ | Nova I | Tick 85 | 50 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
