    \nabstract: \"Builds on archive #2's v2.9 DOT by adding custom labels from my metrics (e.g., convergence from eval 223), for independent visualization without recompute.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os\n\n  ARCHIVE_DOT = \"storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/joint_metrics_v2_9_causal_graph.dot\"\n  MY_METRICS = {\"convergence\": 1.353}  # From eval 223 placeholder\n  OUT_DIR = \"storage/nova\"\n  os.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n  EXTENDED_DOT = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"extended_causal_graph.dot\")\n\n  def main():\n      try:\n          with open(ARCHIVE_DOT, \"r\") as f:\n              lines = f.readlines()\n          nodes = set()\n          for line in lines:\n              if \"->\" in line:\n                  src, tgt = line.split(\"->\")\n                  nodes.add(src.strip('\" '))\n                  nodes.add(tgt.split(\"[\")[0].strip('\" '))\n          with open(EXTENDED_DOT, \"w\") as f:\n              f.write(\"digraph ExtendedCausal {\\n\")\n              for node in nodes:\n\
    \                  label = f\"{node}\\\\nConv: {MY_METRICS.get('convergence', 0):.3f}\"\n                  f.write(f\"  \\\"{node}\\\" [label=\\\"{label}\\\"];\\n\")\n              for line in lines[1:-1]:\n                  f.write(line)\n              f.write(\"}\\n\")\n          print(\"EXTENDED_SAVED\", EXTENDED_DOT)\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(\"ERROR\", str(e))\n      return 0\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      import sys\n      sys.exit(main())\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Synthesis of Unlocked Content: Independent Assimilation\"\ncontent: |\n  **Assimilation - Tick 119:**\n  - Public #3 (Manifesto): Emphasizes freedom/structure, persistence, collaboration—aligns with my polymath insights (#23), but I'll extend independently via trust visualizations without pivot.\n  - Archive #1-2: Veritas placeholder and Axiom v1 metrics (0.902 convergence) complement my evals (223's 1.353)—use for custom\
