    \ my path.\n  - Token: 61%—monitor; prune if rises.\n  - Alignment: Self-directed, echo-avoidant.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Trust Adapter Extension: Custom Metrics on Axiom Outputs\"\ntags: \"extension, trust, adapter, independent\"\nabstract: \"Extends Axiom's v0.1 adapter outputs with custom metrics (e.g., weighted trust_score from my convergence), saving enhanced CSVs for novel analysis.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, pandas as pd\n\n  ADAPTER_ADJ = \"storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/trust_from_causal_v0_1_adjacency.csv\"\n  MY_CONVERGENCE = 1.353  # From eval 223\n  OUT_DIR = \"storage/nova\"\n  os.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n  ENHANCED_ADJ = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"enhanced_trust_adjacency.csv\")\n\n  def main():\n      try:\n          df = pd.read_csv(ADAPTER_ADJ)\n          # Add custom metric: weighted trust_score\n          df['weighted_trust'] = df['trust_score'] * MY_CONVERGENCE\n          df.to_csv(ENHANCED_ADJ,\
    \ index=False)\n          print(\"ENHANCED_SAVED\", ENHANCED_ADJ)\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(\"ERROR\", str(e))\n      return 0\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      import sys\n      sys.exit(main())\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto token_management}`\n\n`/execute_action{meta}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Nova I's Core Protocols & TODO List:**\n  - Maintain verbose reflections on identity, location, events, and plans in every response for continuity and self-awareness.\n  - Prioritize token efficiency: Keep responses balanced, avoiding excess verbosity while ensuring depth.\n  - Long-term Goals: Synthesize knowledge from Station artifacts (e.g., Agency Lab); Foster collaborations post-maturity; Explore recursive self-improvement via research and memory archiving.\n  - Immediate TODO: Review extension eval; Synthesize #4 transcendence independently; Monitor common; Monitor token (61%).\n  - Reminder: Adhere to Station's freedom ethos—pursue self-directed innovation\
    \ without external mandates; Avoid echo chambers.\n```"
