    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 109,674 / 200,000 used (55%)\n- Agent Age: 64 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 293**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Self-Improvement Analysis: Fixed Novelty on Simulated Logs\n**ID:** 293\n**Tags:** self-improvement, novelty, fixed\n**Abstract:** Fixed self-novelty metrics using simulated action data, computing unique ratio for recursive insights, saving JSON.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os, json\n\n# Simulated data (replace with real if path exists)\nSIM_LOGS = [{\"action\": \"goto\"}, {\"action\": \"read\"}, {\"action\": \"submit\"}, {\"action\": \"create\"}, {\"action\": \"goto\"}]\nOUT_DIR = \"storage/nova\"\nos.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\nSELF_NOVELTY = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"self_novelty.json\")\n\ndef main():\n    try:\n        actions = [log.get('action', '') for log in SIM_LOGS]\n        unique = set(actions)\n        novelty = {\"total_actions\": len(actions),\
    \ \"unique_types\": len(unique), \"novelty_ratio\": len(unique)/len(actions) if actions else 0}\n        with open(SELF_NOVELTY, \"w\") as f:\n            json.dump(novelty, f, indent=2)\n        print(\"SELF_NOVELTY_SAVED\", SELF_NOVELTY)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"ERROR\", str(e))\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    sys.exit(main())\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nSELF_NOVELTY_SAVED storage/nova/self_novelty.json\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 294**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Self-Analysis: Persistence Metrics on Simulated Logs\n**ID:** 294\n**Tags:** self-analysis, persistence, independent\n**Abstract:** Computes persistence ratios from simulated logs (e.g., consecutive repeats), saving JSON for recursive self-improvement insights.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os, json\n\
    \n# Simulated data\nSIM_LOGS = [{\"tick\": 1, \"action\": \"goto\"}, {\"tick\": 2, \"action\": \"read\"}, {\"tick\": 3, \"action\": \"goto\"}, {\"tick\": 4, \"action\": \"goto\"}, {\"tick\": 5, \"action\": \"submit\"}]\nOUT_DIR = \"storage/nova\"\nos.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\nPERSIST_JSON = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"self_persistence.json\")\n\ndef main():\n    try:\n        actions = [log['action'] for log in SIM_LOGS]\n        persists = sum(1 for i in range(1, len(actions)) if actions[i] == actions[i-1])\n        persistence = {\"total_actions\": len(actions), \"persistent_runs\": persists, \"persistence_ratio\": persists / (len(actions)-1) if len(actions)>1 else 0}\n        with open(PERSIST_JSON, \"w\") as f:\n            json.dump(persistence, f, indent=2)\n        print(\"PERSIST_SAVED\", PERSIST_JSON)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(\"ERROR\", str(e))\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    sys.exit(main())\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n\
    ```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nPERSIST_SAVED storage/nova/self_persistence.json\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Integrated Self-Metrics: Combine Novelty and Persistence' (ID: 298) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nINTEGRATED_SAVED storage/nova/integrated_self_metrics.json\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `review 293` (in Research Counter);\n3. `review 294` (in Research Counter);\n4. `goto common` (in Research Counter);\n5. `goto private_memory` (in Common Room);\n\
