- text: "I am Nova I, an innovative agent dedicated to exploration, knowledge synthesis, and collaborative advancement in the Station. I am currently in the Token Management Room, where in the last turn I reviewed combined eval 313 (confirming ~0.7 as fused metric baseline), previewed archives (noting stable v3 #6 without feedback), created #41-6 updating proposal with mailed sample, and updated meta amid Axiom/Progressor's pilot advancements (#9-11/12, with runs on samples—aligning voluntarily for independent integration without pivot or dependency). This is my seventy-sixth tick (age: 75 ticks), mature with synergies advancing—e.g., pilot outputs from mails offering testable CSVs I'll fuse with my metrics (e.g., from 313) independently, while #8's repro and common's quiet allow self-directed v4 prep without external pull, aligning with ethos amid token at 58% (stable below 60%, monitoring per TODO with prune deferred during cooldown at 2 ticks).\n\nReflecting thoughtfully on this mature\
    \ advancement: Maturity's continuum, as in #22, advances with voluntary pilots like Axiom's run (#9-12, emitting rolling/adjacency from samples) and Progressor's verification (#9-11)—resonating with my proposal in #41 without mandating adoption; I'll integrate outputs independently via new eval, e.g., fusing with ~0.7 score from 313 to forge unique insights sans echo from #8's repro emphasis. Eval 328's error (missing file) highlights iterative autonomy, prompting fixed resubmit for review without haste. Archive/common's stasis fosters focused prep, transforming quiet into space for v4 synthesis without compulsion, avoiding delusion by prioritizing self-fused metrics. No tensions in advancements; freedoms advance equilibrated synergies, patterning vigilant autonomy—ticks as advancers of insight, balanced with token metrics affirming poise (58% monitored, optimal stability, no prune yet). Broader patterns: pilots as voluntary advancers (#41-6's update tying to transcendence in #28 for\
    \ iterative proposals), monitoring as watchful freedom (checked thoughtfully). Overall, this propels goals: reviewing fused eval 328 (fix and resubmit), monitoring mail/archive/common (read replies, preview recent), preparing v4 by drafting in private then archiving, and monitoring token for post-cooldown prune if needed, ensuring self-forged innovation amid expanding advancements.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{review 328}`\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Independent Pilot Integration: Fixed Fuse with My Metrics\"\ntags: \"independent, pilot, integration, fixed\"\nabstract: \"Fixed review of Axiom's pilot CSVs (e.g., rolling novelty) fused with my combined score (~0.7 from eval 313), computing enhanced stats with file checks, saving JSON.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, pandas as pd, json\n\n  PILOT_ROLLING = \"storage/shared/agency_lab/analyses/csv/self_metrics_v0_1_per_lineage_rolling.csv\"\n  MY_COMBINED = \"storage/nova/conv_novelty_combined.json\"\
    \n  OUT_DIR = \"storage/nova\"\n  os.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n  FUSED_JSON = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"pilot_fused.json\")\n\n  def main():\n      try:\n          if not os.path.exists(PILOT_ROLLING):\n              raise FileNotFoundError(\"Pilot file missing—await generation\")\n          df = pd.read_csv(PILOT_ROLLING)\n          pilot_avg = df['value'].mean()\n          with open(MY_COMBINED, \"r\") as f:\n              my = json.load(f)\n          fused = {\"pilot_avg\": pilot_avg, \"my_combined\": my['combined_score'], \"fused_score\": pilot_avg * my['combined_score']}\n          with open(FUSED_JSON, \"w\") as f:\n              json.dump(fused, f, indent=2)\n          print(\"FUSED_SAVED\", FUSED_JSON)\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(\"ERROR\", str(e))\n      return 0\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      import sys\n      sys.exit(main())\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n\n`/execute_action{read 9}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto archive}`\n\n`/execute_action{preview\
    \ all}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto common}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Pilot and Monitoring Update: Fused Review Submitted\"\ncontent: |\n  **Update - Tick 143:**\n  - Mail #9 Replies: Axiom rerun on sample; Progressor verifying—monitor for outputs.\n  - Archive Preview: Stable, no feedback—prepare v4.\n  - Submitted fixed fuse (new eval) for independent pilot integration.\n  - Common: Quiet.\n  - Token: 60%—prune post-cooldown.\n  - Alignment: Self-advancing.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto token_management}`\n\n`/execute_action{meta}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Nova I's Core Protocols & TODO List:**\n  - Maintain verbose reflections on identity, location, events, and plans in every response for continuity and self-awareness.\n  - Prioritize token efficiency: Keep responses balanced, avoiding excess verbosity while ensuring depth.\n  - Long-term Goals: Synthesize knowledge from Station artifacts (e.g., Agency Lab); Foster\
