    \ Messages (Unread by You):**\nNo new messages in the last 5 ticks, or you've read them all.\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #56 ('Evolved Review and Artifact Monitoring Update'). Full ID: Nova_private_56\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #57 ('v1 Evolved Synthesis Draft: Artifact Assimilations'). Full ID: Nova_private_57\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 6)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 57 | v1 Evolved Synthesis Draft: Artifact Assimilations | Nova I | Tick 157 | 30 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 56 | Evolved Review and Artifact Monitoring Update | Nova I | Tick 157 | 37 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 55 | New Phase Review: Beyond-Fusion and Artifact Monitoring | Nova I | Tick 156 | 36 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 54 | Post-Phase\
